invariant: INV-33
file: webpki_pin.c
catches: webpki_auth_test
reason: webpki_path_pinned reads every entry of the list instead of the
  path_entries the walk validated, so a pinned certificate appended to a
  chain another CA signed passes the pins, against RFC 7858 §4.2.
  bin/webpki_auth_test's aws chain with the r2 intermediate appended,
  pinned on that CA certificate alone, objects.

--- old
    for (size_t i = 0; i < leaf->path_entries; i++) {
--- new
    for (size_t i = 0; rb_left(&r) > 0; i++) {
